    { num: "2", text: "Agents can learn situational self-awareness via lightweight heuristic labeling and special tokens — no expensive human annotation required." },
    { num: "3", text: "KnowSelf (Llama-8B) achieves 84.33% on ALFWorld, outperforming GPT-4o ReAct (76.12%) and GPT-4o ExpeL (79.85%)." },
